e=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#0000ff\"><font color=\"#0900ff\" face=\"굴림\">. </font><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">일반 </font>취업동아리 </span></font></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구성요건</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 재학생 </span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명 이상의 회원으로 구성되어야 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">휴학생 및 미취업 졸업생은 구성원의 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">20% </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이하로 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업 및 진로와 관련하여 뚜렷한 목적성이 있어야 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구비서류 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 등록신청서</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-